        "customDisplayName": "Concatenate water-body-testing tables for 2002\u20132023; filter to Beach Type Description='Marine' (case-insensitive); compute exceedance indicator isExceed where Violation equals 'yes' (case-insensitive); aggregate by Year to average exceedance rate (mean of isExceed) and sample count; compute year-over-year difference diffFromPrev = exceedRate - lag(exceedRate); return the Year with the maximum diffFromPrev (excluding first year with NaN diff) plus diagnostic values.",
